; xfail: wrong number of arguments for U.First: got 2, expected 1
;
; A union ARM carries at most one payload, so a variant construction takes at
; most one argument — and until 2026-08-18 both planner paths that build one
; read component 0 and DROPPED the rest without a word, rc 0: `U.First(1, 2)`
; answered 1. This is the resolved path (the is_variant_ctor gate);
; xfail_variant_arg_arity_bare.scaly covers the s185 rescue, which is a
; different site with the same symptom.

define U union (First: int  Second: int)

let u U.First(1, 2)
print("compiled\n")
